------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modified version
------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is a modified version of DDNet AI, maintained at
https://github.com/Evelynkaz/DDNet-AI. Since 2026-09-27 it is being
rewritten in Rust, with a neural network constrained by the Drosophila
connectome ("the fly") and a web interface replacing the Electron window.
It is not the original program by Wranked1; the original is available at
https://github.com/Wranked1/DDNet-AI.
